{"id":"3a4a9f6b8477e5c8","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset.md","title":"ZFC Order11 Ideal Of Poset","display":"df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Ideal Of Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Ideal Of Poset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order11-ideal-of-poset — ZFC Order11 Ideal Of Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,I,\\leq_P\\in V\">\\(P,I,\\leq_P\\in V\\)</span> (poset carrier, ideal candidate, and order relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S\\)</span> (partial-order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9ee45afab4c00dd5\" href=\"?note=9ee45afab4c00dd5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-partial-order\">58-df-zfc-partial-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11IdealOfPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11IdealOfPoset}_S\\)</span> (poset-ideal predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11IdealOfPoset}_S(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land I\\subseteq P\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to y\\in I)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\exists z\\in I\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order11\\text{-}ideal\\text{-}of\\text{-}poset}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrder11IdealOfPoset}_S(I,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{PartialOrder}_S(P,\\leq_P)\\land I\\subseteq P\\land I\\neq\\emptyset\\land\n\\Bigl(\\forall x\\in I\\;\\forall y\\in P\\;(\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\to y\\in I)\\Bigr)\\land\n\\forall x,y\\in I\\;\\exists z\\in I\\;(\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in\\leq_P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ideal definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-partial-order]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-partial-order","status":"resolved","id":"9ee45afab4c00dd5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp